title Caravan courier -- a correction is carried to the reader who never comes back
prompt Keaton asked the loop to be Kyri in Radiant Style, read the operator card and the itineraries, pick up the running thread from the newest log's recommend, close open agent-closable reds first, take the next agent-doable lap Lindy-first crux-first, deep-read one council-rota doc, and send each finished increment as its own signed round.
think Read context/KYRI.md and context/RADIANT_STYLE.md before anything else, so the voice shapes the lap rather than being applied to it afterward. Then crux/REMEMBER.md whole, then the top three rows of session-logs/README.md with the newest recommend line.
think Standfast first. Walked the living rows of crux/REDS.md: %96, %97, %81, %83, %84 all carry closure notes, and nothing in the living ledger stands open. No red books this lap's allocation, so the constructive queue is the honest next move.
think The running thread named its own crux without ambiguity. The amend rung's recommend line: an amendment waits on the wire for somebody to come back and read it, which is no correction at all for an operator who never returns, and asks whether a record should ever reach outward rather than only publish.
think Council rota, lap index 60 mod 27 = 6: deep-read foundations/20260814-071700_hardware-and-right-to-repair.md. Its discipline landed on this lap directly -- what forgets protects, what opens endures, and every gate named honestly rather than routed around. A rung that reaches outside its own directory is exactly the kind of claim that wants naming plainly rather than assuming.
think Named the rung under the Comlink tendency -- clear, fun, safe. Courier is a plain warm word a newcomer grasps at once, collides with nothing seated (notify.rye is the process doorbell, a distinct concept), and says what the rung does. Grepped before seating.
think Designed the fold before writing a line of it. Dispatch = waiting | carried at the plan beside the notice, since it instructs about how far a record reaches rather than about any one phase. The address arrives on the wire beside the reading, since a word carried away and the place it was carried to are one fact about one person.
think The measurement had to weigh something nothing below could see. Below weighs a record against its reader; this weighs the answer against the distance between where it was written and where the reader is. A correction that never travels is a letter left in the writer's own drawer -- entirely honest, read by nobody.
think Bounded the measurement by its supply, deliberately. A reader who left no address is a duty nobody can discharge, and counting it would be measuring the weather; only a correction with somewhere to go counts as left waiting. Said so in the doc comment rather than leaving it inferred.
think Built the rung by carrying the rung below whole and adding one tier -- the arc's standing shape. Every accessor gained one .inner, the Report wraps amend's, and the amendment family re-exports rather than being re-derived.
think The delivery lands in caravan/.readers, outside note_dir entirely, and a comptime invariant asserts the two directories differ. That assert is the rung's claim written as a check: the first outward reach of the whole arc is visible as a record leaving the place records are kept.
think The address is bounded and character-checked before a byte of it reaches a path -- letters, digits, and underscore only, never empty, never past 16 bytes. A run cannot be talked into walking somewhere it was not asked to go.
think Six RED paths proven on metal before any GREEN claim, including a planted control that delivers honestly and delivers the wrong letter, so the box read-back is proven a check rather than decoration. Restored and re-proved GREEN after each.
obs The price is the finding's other half, and it is nothing but the walk. Both runs take up 6 phases, absorb 3, lose 3, take the same judgment back, re-seat the same 3, post the same correction, spend the same 6 dependents, and settle carried either way. Only the journey moves.
obs The lap earned one honest compiler refusal: readPositionalAll's error set carries no EndOfStream on this seam, so the address read was rewritten to answer null rather than to catch a name that does not exist there. The compiler was right and the guess was wrong.
obs Bounding the measurement by the supply is a real trade, named rather than hidden. A reader who cannot be found is genuinely unserved; counting them would make the number unfalsifiable, and this arc's discipline is that every count closes.
loom witness=caravan_courier_witness choir_rungs_green=61 red_paths_proven=6 asserts=236
file caravan/courier.rye the rung -- Dispatch, the bounded address, the reader's box outside the wire, four refusals by name, and the lap run twice
file tools/caravan_courier_witness.rish the witness -- reads the reader's own box rather than trusting the run's telling, and names all six RED paths it proved first
file tools/caravan_suite_witness.rish registers the new rung, so the choir's bijection reads 61 and nothing runs unheard
file caravan/README.md the durable prose for the rung, seated above Held so the arc reads in order
recommend keep-going the arc has answered for reach at every moment of a dependent's life, repaired what a fall cost, weighed the losses nobody spoke to, taken back its own stale judgments, written to the reader those judgments misled, and now carries that letter to where the reader actually is -- so the question standing above it is what a plan owes a reader whose box it cannot reach: a delivery this run believes in because it read its own writing back, which proves the letter left rather than that anybody opened it, and asks whether a record should ever wait for the reader's own hand to answer.
